  <section itemprop="claims" itemscope>
    <h2>Claims (<span itemprop="count">16</span>)</h2>
    
    <div itemprop="content" html><div mxw-id="PCLM90727389" lang="EN" load-source="patent-office" class="claims">
    <div class="claim"> <div id="CLM-00001" num="00001" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>1</b>. A separator comprising a polyolefin base film and having a tensile strength of 1,900 kgf/cm<sup>2 </sup>or more both in a machine direction and in a transverse direction, and a thermal shrinkage of 1% or less both in the machine direction and in the transverse direction as measured after being left at 105° C. for 1 hour.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00002" num="00002" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>2</b>. The separator according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00001">claim 1</claim-ref>, wherein the separator has a higher tensile strength in the machine direction than in the transverse direction.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00003" num="00003" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>3</b>. The separator according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00001">claim 1</claim-ref>, wherein the polyolefin base film is a polyethylene-containing base film.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00004" num="00004" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>4</b>. The separator according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00003">claim 3</claim-ref>, wherein the polyethylene has a weight average molecular weight of 500,000 g/mol or more.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00005" num="00005" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>5</b>. The separator according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00004">claim 4</claim-ref>, wherein the polyethylene has a density of 0.9 g/cc to 1.0 g/cc.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00006" num="00006" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>6</b>. The separator according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00001">claim 1</claim-ref>, wherein the separator has a puncture strength per unit thickness of 40 gf/μm or more.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00007" num="00007" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>7</b>. The separator according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00001">claim 1</claim-ref>, wherein the separator has a tensile strength of 2,000 kgf/cm<sup>2 </sup>or more in the machine direction.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim"> <div id="CLM-00008" num="00008" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>8</b>. A method for manufacturing a separator, comprising:
<div class="claim-text">stretching a polyolefin base film in a machine direction and/or in a transverse direction; and</div> <div class="claim-text">temporarily stopping stretching of the polyolefin base film at least once during stretching of the polyolefin base film in the machine direction and/or in the transverse direction.</div> </div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00009" num="00009" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>9</b>. The method according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00008">claim 8</claim-ref>, wherein the temporarily stopping is performed after the base film is stretched to 40% or more of a final stretching factor of the base film.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00010" num="00010" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>10</b>. The method according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00009">claim 9</claim-ref>, wherein the temporarily stopping is performed after the base film is stretched to 50% or more of the final stretching factor of the base film.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00011" num="00011" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>11</b>. The method according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00008">claim 8</claim-ref>, wherein the stretching of the polyolefin base film in the machine direction and/or in the transverse direction includes a series of stretching in the machine direction and stretching in the transverse direction several times, and temporary stopping is performed at least once in the course of the series of stretching in the machine direction and stretching in the transverse direction several times.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00012" num="00012" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>12</b>. The method according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00011">claim 11</claim-ref>, wherein the temporarily stopping is performed once to five times in the course of the series of stretching in the machine direction and stretching in the transverse direction several times.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00013" num="00013" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>13</b>. The method according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00008">claim 8</claim-ref>, wherein the temporarily stopping includes stopping stretching of the polyolefin base film for 3 to 60 seconds.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00014" num="00014" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>14</b>. The method according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00008">claim 8</claim-ref>, wherein, when the base film is stretched to a stretching factor of less than 5×5 times in the machine direction and in the transverse direction, the temporarily stopping is performed for less than 10 seconds.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00015" num="00015" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>15</b>. The method according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00008">claim 8</claim-ref>, wherein, when the base film is stretched to a stretching factor of 5×5 times or more in the machine direction and in the transverse direction, the temporarily stopping is performed for 10 seconds or more.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00016" num="00016" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>16</b>. A secondary battery comprising a cathode, an anode, and the separator according to <claim-ref idref="CLM-00001">claim 1</claim-ref> disposed between the cathode and the anode. </div>
    </div>
  </div> </div>
  </div>
  </section>

